Setatsiyun Miyamae (宮前駅, Miyamae-eki) yaiku &lt;a href="setatsiyun%20sepur"&gt;setatsiyun sepur&lt;/a&gt; sing ana ing kutha &lt;a href="Wakayama%20%28kutha%29"&gt;Wakayama&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Prefektur%20Wakayama"&gt;Prefektur Wakayama&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;, sing digarap déning &lt;a href="West%20Japan%20Railway%20Company"&gt;West Japan Railway Company&lt;/a&gt; (JR West).
<h2>Jalur</h2>
Jalur.
Setatsiyun Miyamae diladèni déning &lt;a href="Jalur%20Utami%20Kisei"&gt;Jalur Utami Kisei&lt;/a&gt; (Jalur Kinokuni), lan adohé 378,8 kilometer saka &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20terminal"&gt;terminus&lt;/a&gt; jalur kasebut ing &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Kameyama%20%28Mie%29"&gt;Setatsiyun Kameyama&lt;/a&gt; lan 198,6 kilometer saka &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Shing%C5%AB"&gt;Shingū&lt;/a&gt;.
