<doc id="192364" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=192364" title="Setatsiyun Wakayama">
Setatsiyun Wakayama

Setatsiyun Wakayama (和歌山駅, Wakayama-eki) yaiku &lt;a href="setatsiyun%20sepur"&gt;setatsiyun sepur&lt;/a&gt; sing ana ing kutha &lt;a href="Wakayama%20%28kutha%29"&gt;Wakayama&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Prefektur%20Wakayama"&gt;Prefektur Wakayama&lt;/a&gt;, Jepang, sing digarap bebarengan déning &lt;a href="West%20Japan%20Railway%20Company"&gt;West Japan Railway Company&lt;/a&gt; (JR West) lan parusahan sepur swasta Wakayama Electric Railway.
