<doc id="192647" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=192647" title="Santo Anthonius">
Santo Anthonius

Santo Anthonius paling asring nuduhaké &lt;a href="Anthonius%20saka%20Padua"&gt;Anthonius saka Padua&lt;/a&gt;, uga dikenal minangka Santo Anthonius saka Lisbon, santo pangreksa barang sing ilang. Jeneng iki bisa uga ngrujuk marang:
<h2>Wong</h2>
<ul>
<li>Anthonius saka Antiokhia (266-302), Martir ing Diocletian. Dina riyaya: 9 Januari.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Antonius"&gt;Anthonius Agung&lt;/a&gt; (251–356), Santo Kristen Mesir lan Bapa Gurun. Dina riyaya: 17 utawa 30 Januari.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Anthonius%20saka%20Padua"&gt;Anthonius saka Padua&lt;/a&gt; (1195–1231), Dokor Greja, uga dikenal minangka Santo Anthonius saka Lisbon. Dina riyaya: 13 Juni.</li>
<li>Anthony the Hermit (c. 468 – c. 520), uga dikenal minangka Antony of Lérins. Dina riyaya: 28 Desember.</li>
<li>Antony the Younger (785–865), biksu Bizantium. Dina riyaya: 1 Desember.</li>
<li>Anthony of Kiev (983–1073), uga dikenal minangka Anthony of the Caves. Dina riyaya: 23 Juli.</li>
<li>Anthony saka Roma (tilar donya 1147), uga dikenal minangka Antony Rimlyanin. Dina riyaya: 17 Januari lan 3 Agustus.</li>
<li>Antoninus saka Florence (1389–1459), uga dikenal minangka Anthony saka Florence. Dina riyaya: 10 Mei.</li>
<li>Anthony of Siya (1479–1556), pangadeg Biara Antonievo-Siysky. Dina riyaya: 7 Desember.</li>
<li>Anthony saka St. Ann Galvão (1739–1822), uga dikenal minangka Frei Galvão. Dina riyaya: 11 Mei.</li>
<li>Anthony Mary Claret (1807–1870), pangadeg Missionary Sons of the Immaculate Heart of Mary. Dina riyaya: 24 Oktober.</li>
</ul>
