<doc id="193070" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=193070" title="ExifTool">
ExifTool

ExifTool yaiku program &lt;a href="piranti%20alus%20mardika%20lan%20sumber%20binuka"&gt;piranti alus mardika lan sumber binuka&lt;/a&gt; kanggo maca, nulis, lan manipulasi &lt;a href="m%C3%A8tadata"&gt;mètadata&lt;/a&gt; gambar, audio, vidéo, lan &lt;a href="Portable%20Document%20Format"&gt;PDF&lt;/a&gt;. Program iki minangka program &lt;a href="lintas%20platform"&gt;lintas platform&lt;/a&gt; kang cumepak awujud pustaka &lt;a href="Perl"&gt;Perl&lt;/a&gt; (Image::ExifTool) lan aplikasi &lt;a href="mukantara%20baris%20par%C3%A9ntah"&gt;baris paréntah&lt;/a&gt;. ExifTool nyengkuyung akèh jinis mètadata kaya ta &lt;a href="Exif"&gt;Exif&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="IPTC%20Information%20Interchange%20Model"&gt;IPTC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Extensible%20Metadata%20Platform"&gt;XMP&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="JFIF"&gt;JFIF&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="GeoTIFF"&gt;GeoTIFF&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="ICC%20Profile"&gt;ICC Profile&lt;/a&gt;, Photoshop IRB, &lt;a href="FlashPix"&gt;FlashPix&lt;/a&gt;, AFCP, &lt;a href="ID3"&gt;ID3&lt;/a&gt;, lan uga format mètadata mirunggan kang dianggo déning produsèn &lt;a href="kam%C3%A9ra%20digital"&gt;kaméra digital&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Énkapsulasi mètainformasi</h2>
Énkapsulasi mètainformasi.
ExifTool nganggo format &lt;a href="m%C3%A8tadata"&gt;mètadata&lt;/a&gt; binukané dhéwé. Meta Information Encapsulation (MIE) rinancang kanggo ngapsulaké mètainformasi saka akèh sumber, jroning wujud binèr utawa tèkstual, tuwin mbundel bebarengan karo jinis barkas apa waé. MIE bisa arupa barkas tunggal, mbungkus data kang wis cumepak, utawa dianggo minangka &lt;a href="sidecar%20file"&gt;sidecar file&lt;/a&gt;, kang ngemu mètadata &lt;a href="Exif"&gt;Exif&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Extensible%20Metadata%20Platform"&gt;XMP&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Panganggo</h2>
