Odakyu Electric Railway

Odakyu Electric Railway Company, Ltd. (小田急電鉄株式会社, Odakyū Dentetsu kabushiki gaisha), sing umum dikenal minangka Odakyū, ya iku sawijining perusahaan sepur utama sing adhedhasar ing &lt;a href="Tokyo"&gt;Tokyo&lt;/a&gt;, Jepang, sing misuwur amarga sepur &lt;a href="Romancecar"&gt;Romancecar&lt;/a&gt; saka sepur ekspres winates saka Tokyo menyang &lt;a href="Odawara%2C%20Kanagawa"&gt;Odawara&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Enoshima"&gt;Enoshima&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tama%20New%20Town"&gt;Tama New Town&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Hakone%2C%20Kanagawa"&gt;Hakone&lt;/a&gt;.
Odakyu Electric Railway Company dadi mbentuk inti saka &lt;a href="Odakyu%20Group"&gt;Odakyu Group&lt;/a&gt;, sing dumadi saka 101 perusahaan lan kalebu &lt;a href="Enoshima%20Electric%20Railway"&gt;Enoshima Electric Railway&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hakone%20Tozan%20Railway"&gt;Hakone Tozan Railway&lt;/a&gt;, #ALIH, #ALIH, lan hotel #ALIH.
<h2>Jalur</h2>
Jalur.
Odakyu duwe telung jalur sepur langsung, lan telung jalur liyane liwat anak perusahaan. Uga ngoperasikaké sepur menyang &lt;a href="Tokyo%20Metro%20Chiyoda%20Line"&gt;Jalur Tokyo Metro Chiyoda&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="J%C5%8Dban%20Line"&gt;Jalur Jōban&lt;/a&gt; JR East, lan &lt;a href="Gotemba%20Line"&gt;Jalur Gotemba&lt;/a&gt; JR Central.
<ul>
<li>Ora kalebu cabang penghubung antara Jalur Odawara lan Jalur Gotemba JR Central cedhak Stasiun Shin-Matsuda.</li>
<li>Akeh sepur Jalur Odakyu Tama (lan sepur Jalur Odawara sing dipilih saka &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Hon-Atsugi"&gt;Hon-Atsugi&lt;/a&gt;) terus menyang jalur Chiyoda lan Jōban kanggo stasiun &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Ayase"&gt;Ayase&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Toride"&gt;Toride&lt;/a&gt;. Layanan iki diwiwiti ing taun 1978 antarane stasiun Hon-Atsugi lan &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Abiko%20%28Chiba%29"&gt;Abiko&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>Sawetara sepur Odakyū terus ing &lt;a href="Hakone%20Tozan%20Line"&gt;Jalur Hakone Tozan&lt;/a&gt; diduweni dening Odakyu menyang &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Hakone-Yumoto"&gt;Hakone-Yumoto&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>Sepur ekspres winates &lt;a href="Mt.%20Fuji%20%28sepur%29"&gt;Mt. Fuji&lt;/a&gt; lumaku saka Shinjuku liwat &lt;a href="Gotemba%20Line"&gt;Jalur Gotemba&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Central%20Japan%20Railway%20Company"&gt;JR Central&lt;/a&gt; menyang &lt;a href="Stasiun%20Gotemba"&gt;Stasiun Gotemba&lt;/a&gt; kaping wolu saben dina.</li>
