<doc id="193293" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=193293" title="Greg Kroah-Hartman">
Greg Kroah-Hartman

Greg Kroah-Hartman (GKH) yaiku pangembang kernel &lt;a href="Linux"&gt;Linux&lt;/a&gt;. Kawit April 2013, piyambaké dadi pangopèn kernel Linux vèrsi stabil, subsistem stag, &lt;a href="Universal%20Serial%20Bus"&gt;USB&lt;/a&gt;, core driver, subsistem kernel &lt;a href="debugfs%20%28kernel%20Linux%29"&gt;debugfs&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kref"&gt;kref&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kobject"&gt;kobject&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="sysfs"&gt;sysfs&lt;/a&gt;, saha &lt;a href="User%20space"&gt;Userspace&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Input/output"&gt;I/O&lt;/a&gt; (karo Hans J. Koch), lan lapisan &lt;a href="tty%20%28Unix%29"&gt;TTY&lt;/a&gt;. Piyambaké uga nggawé &lt;a href="linux-hotplug"&gt;linux-hotplug&lt;/a&gt;, proyèk &lt;a href="udev"&gt;udev&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Linux%20Driver%20Project"&gt;Linux Driver Project&lt;/a&gt;. Kajaba iku, piyambaké makarya ing &lt;a href="Novell"&gt;Novell&lt;/a&gt; ing dhivisi Lab &lt;a href="SUSE%20Linux"&gt;SUSE&lt;/a&gt;, lan nganti 1 Fèbruari 2012 makarya ing &lt;a href="Linux%20Foundation"&gt;Linux Foundation&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Biografi</h2>
Biografi.
Kroah-Hartman iku rekan panganggit Linux Device Drivers (édhisi ka-3) lan panganggit Linux Kernel in a Nutshell, saha piyambaké tau dadi pambesut ing &lt;a href="Linux%20Journal"&gt;Linux Journal&lt;/a&gt;. Piyambaké uga nyumbang artikel menyang &lt;a href="LWN.net"&gt;LWN.net&lt;/a&gt;, situs pawartaning Linux.
Kroah-Hartman kerep maringi pitulung bab dhokumèntasi pangrembakaning kernel lan driver lumantar sesorah lan tutorial. Ing 2006, piyambaké mbabar &lt;a href="CD%20image"&gt;CD image&lt;/a&gt; kang ngandhut matéri pangenalan pangrembakaning device driver Linux marang pamrogram.
Piyambaké uga miwiti pangrembakaning &lt;a href="openSUSE%20Tumbleweed"&gt;openSUSE Tumbleweed&lt;/a&gt;, édhisi &lt;a href="rolling%20release"&gt;rolling release&lt;/a&gt; openSUSE.
Ing April 2021, Kroah-Hartman peparing wara-wara putusan kang ora mikolèhi &lt;a href="Universitas%20Minnesota"&gt;Universitas Minnesota&lt;/a&gt; nyumbang kodhe menyang kernel Linux lan mbalèkaké sakabèhing tambalan (patch) saka Universitas Minnesota sawisé para panalitiné sengaja nambahi tetuma (bug) ing &lt;a href="penetration%20test"&gt;penetration test&lt;/a&gt; kang ora kawenang.
