<doc id="193383" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=193383" title="Sakura (sepur)">
Sakura (sepur)

Sakura (さくら, Sakura Cherry Blossom) ya iku layanan &lt;a href="shinkansen"&gt;shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; kacepetan dhuwur sing dioperasikake antara &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Shin-Osaka"&gt;Shin-Osaka&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Kagoshima-Ch%C5%AB%C5%8D"&gt;Kagoshima-Chūō&lt;/a&gt; ing Jepang wiwit 12 Maret 2011.
Iku biyèn minangka layanan sepur turu &lt;a href="ekspres%20winates"&gt;ekspres winates&lt;/a&gt; sing dilakokno dening &lt;a href="JR%20Kyushu"&gt;JR Kyushu&lt;/a&gt;, sing lumaku saka &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Tokyo"&gt;Tokyo&lt;/a&gt; menyang &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Nagasaki%20%28Nagasaki%29"&gt;Nagasaki&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Sasebo"&gt;Sasebo&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Kyushu"&gt;Kyushu&lt;/a&gt;, Jepang. Layanan sadurunge iki mandheg ing taun 2005 amarga jadwal sing direvisi.
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
<h3>Layanan ekspres winates</h3>
Sajarah.
Layanan ekspres winates.
Sakura kapisan dikenalaké ing 1 April 1951 minangka layanan ekspres winates wayah awan antara Tokyo lan Osaka. Layanan iki mandheg ing Oktober 1958.
Layanan sepur turu Sakura diwiwiti ing 20 Juli 1959 nggunakake sepur turu seri 20 seri. Wiwit Maret 1972, sepur kasebut dianyari kanthi sepur turu seri 14.
Wiwit 4 Desember 1999, Sakura lumaku bebarengan karo layanan &lt;a href="Hayabusa%20%28sepur%29"&gt;Hayabusa&lt;/a&gt; antarane Tokyo lan &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Tosu"&gt;Tosu&lt;/a&gt;. Layanan pungkasan ditindakake ing wayah bengi ing 28 Fèbruari 2005.
<h3>Layanan shinkansen</h3>
Layanan shinkansen.
Wiwit 12 Maret 2011, jeneng Sakura diuripake maneh kanggo layanan shinkansen anyar sing beroperasi antara &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Shin-Osaka"&gt;Shin-Osaka&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Kagoshima-Ch%C5%AB%C5%8D"&gt;Kagoshima-Chūō&lt;/a&gt; nggunakake sepur anyar JR West &lt;a href="N700%20Series%20Shinkansen%238-car%20S%20sets%20%28N700-7000%20series%29"&gt;seri N700-7000&lt;/a&gt; lan sepur JR Kyushu &lt;a href="N700%20Series%20Shinkansen%238-car%20R%20sets%20%28N700-8000%20series%29"&gt;seri N700-8000&lt;/a&gt; 8 gerbong.
Sepur Sakura beroperasi saben jam sepisan antara Shin-Osaka lan Kagoshima-Chūō sedina muput. Siji layanan esuk mangkat saka Kumamoto menyang Shin-Osaka. Uga ana layanan Sakura tambahan antarane &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Hakata"&gt;Hakata&lt;/a&gt; lan Kagoshima-Chuo ing wayah awan. Sawetara Sakura lumaku ing Kyushu Shinkansen dioperasèkaké déning sepur &lt;a href="800%20Series%20Shinkansen"&gt;seri 800&lt;/a&gt; 6 gerbong.
Kaya layanan &lt;a href="Hikari%20%28sepur%29"&gt;Hikari&lt;/a&gt; sing ana ing jalur Tokaido &amp; Sanyo Shinkansen, Sakura minangka layanan paling cepet ing jalur Sanyo &amp; Kyushu Shinkansen sing bisa digunakake karo Japan Rail Pass.
