<doc id="193442" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=193442" title="Hayabusa (sepur)">
Hayabusa (sepur)

Hayabusa (はやぶさ, "&lt;a href="Alap-alap%20kawah"&gt;Peregrine falcon&lt;/a&gt;") yaiku layanan &lt;a href="shinkansen"&gt;shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; kacepetan dhuwur sing dioperasikake dening &lt;a href="East%20Japan%20Railway%20Company"&gt;East Japan Railway Company&lt;/a&gt; (JR East) lan &lt;a href="Hokkaido%20Railway%20Company"&gt;Hokkaido Railway Company&lt;/a&gt; (JR Hokkaido) antarane Tokyo lan &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Shin-Hakodate-Hokuto"&gt;Shin-Hakodate-Hokuto&lt;/a&gt; ing Jepang wiwit 26 Maret 2016. Jeneng iki biyen digunakake kanggo layanan &lt;a href="gerbong%20turu"&gt;gerbong turu&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="ekspres%20winates"&gt;ekspres winates&lt;/a&gt; sing dilakokno dening &lt;a href="JR%20Kyushu"&gt;JR Kyushu&lt;/a&gt;, sing beroperasi saka Tokyo menyang &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Kumamoto"&gt;Kumamoto&lt;/a&gt;, lan ora diterusake ing Maret 2009.
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
<h3>Layanan gerbong turu (1958–2009)</h3>
Sajarah.
Layanan gerbong turu (1958–2009).
Layanan Hayabusa diwiwiti ing 1 Oktober 1958, beroperasi antara Tokyo lan &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Kagoshima"&gt;Kagoshima&lt;/a&gt;. Wiwit 20 Juli 1960, sepur iku diapikake kanthi 20 seri gerbong turu, lan dilanjutake menyang lan saka Nishi-Kagoshima (saiki &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Kagoshima-Ch%C5%AB%C5%8D"&gt;Kagoshima-Chūō&lt;/a&gt;). Wiwit 9 Maret 1975, sepur kasebut dianyari kanthi 24 seri gerbong turu. Layanan gerbong mangan mandheg wiwit Maret 1993.
Wiwit 4 Desember 1999, Hayabusa digabungake karo layanan Sakura antarane Tokyo lan &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Tosu"&gt;Tosu&lt;/a&gt;. Wiwit 1 Maret 2005, Hayabusa digabungake karo layanan Fuji antara Tokyo lan Moji, sawise mandhegake layanan Sakura sing sadurunge dioperasikake bebarengan karo Hayabusa.
Pungkasan, amarga jumlah penumpang sing suda, Hayabusa, bebarengan karo layanan mitra, &lt;a href="Fuji%20%28sepur%29"&gt;Fuji&lt;/a&gt;, mandheg saka awal jadwal sing direvisi ing 14 Maret 2009.
<h3>Layanan shinkansen (2011–)</h3>
Layanan shinkansen (2011–).
Wiwit 5 Maret 2011, jeneng Hayabusa diuripake maneh kanggo layanan shinkansen 300&amp;nbsp;km/jam anyar sing dioperasikake JR East antarane Tokyo lan &lt;a href="Setatsiyun%20Shin-Aomori"&gt;Shin-Aomori&lt;/a&gt; nggunakake sepur &lt;a href="E5%20series"&gt;seri E5&lt;/a&gt; anyar, lan dilanjutake menyang &lt;a href="Stasiun%20Shin-Hakodate-Hokuto"&gt;Stasiun Shin-Hakodate-Hokuto&lt;/a&gt; ing 26 Maret. 2016.
